{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39989","headline":"寄华山司空侍郎二首 二 · 徐夤","name":"寄华山司空侍郎二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"非云非鹤不从容，谁敢轻量傲世踪。\n紫殿几徴王佐业，青山未拆诏书封。\n闲吟每待秋空月，早起长先野寺钟。\n前古负材多爲国，满怀经济欲何从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}